  (features/vehicles/components/telemetry-panels/MediaNavigationPanel.tsx). The
  second group backs the native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / error /
  empty copy), so the Swift sources hold no English prose literals. Unit labels
  ("km", "mi", "ft") are unit literals carried in code, not translated strings.
*/

